# Keep the modules in one unit or plant area, without the library.
#
# Change OT-SR-037 to your unit or area name. It matches every item whose plant area contains that
# text, e.g. OT/OT-SR-037. Classes, composites and named sets are left out, because the target
# system normally has them already: check Export check before saving.
SELECT_NONE
PLANT_AREA Contains <OT-SR-037>,<True>,<Select>
